cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "ProbaProjet: linear regression in R, a student-versus-AI comparison"
abstract: >-
  Linear regression project at Polytech Nice Sophia (MAM3): simple regression
  with inference and residual diagnostics, multiple and polynomial regression,
  ANOVA and variable selection on seven datasets, in R. Each part is done first
  by the students alone, then with AI assistance, and the report compares the
  two approaches section by section.
